  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat and cook the onion for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the sweet potatoes, tomatoes, broth and cayenne and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat and simmer, covered, for 15 to 20 minutes, until the potatoes are tender.",
    "Whisk the peanut butter with a ladle of hot broth, then stir it back into the pot.",
    "Add the kale and simmer for 5 to 10 minutes, until tender.",
    "Season with salt, top with chopped peanuts and serve."
